  "prefLabel": "Plc 302.06 Foreign jurisdiction",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 302.06 “Foreign jurisdiction” means a jurisdiction that is outside of any state of the U.S., the District of Columbia, the Commonwealth of Puerto Rico, a trust territory of the Pacific Islands, or any territory or possession of the United States.\n\nSource. 14305, eff 8-19-25, EXPIRES: 8-19-35",
